 "content": {
  "raw": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 40px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(56px, 6.7vw, 96px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 40px);padding-bottom:clamp(56px, 6.7vw, 96px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-okruszki\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-okruszki\"><a href=\"/\">Strona główna</a> › <a href=\"/dla-kogo/\">Dla kogo</a> › Biura rachunkowe</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-hero-tekst\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-hero-tekst\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">02 · Księgowość</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Strona dla biura rachunkowego, która <em>umawia</em> rozmowy</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-wstep\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-wstep\">W sezonie PIT i przy zmianach przepisów telefon dzwoni bez przerwy. Strona odpowiada na stałe pytania, a nowy klient sam umawia rozmowę o współpracy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-etykiety\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"6px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-etykiety\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-etykieta\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-etykieta\">pytania o KSeF</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-etykieta\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-etykieta\">ceny „od”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-etykieta\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-etykieta\">umawianie rozmów</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"ze-strzalka\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button ze-strzalka\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#ankieta\">Wyceń stronę w 5 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/rozmowa/\">Umów 30 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-podpis\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-podpis\">Bez zobowiązań · propozycja w 48 h</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"backgroundColor\":\"piasek\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"problem\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-piasek-background-color has-background\" id=\"problem\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"40%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Problem</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">W sezonie linia jest <em>zajęta</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"60%\",\"className\":\"mp-akapity\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column mp-akapity\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Od lutego do kwietnia telefon dzwoni od rana, a wiele rozmów to te same pytania: o KSeF, o ceny, o zmianę biura.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nowa firma, która chce zapytać o współpracę, trafia na zajętą linię i dzwoni do następnego biura z listy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"co-dostajesz\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"co-dostajesz\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-naglowek-sekcji\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-naglowek-sekcji\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Co dostajesz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rozmowa z nowym klientem, który wie, czego <em>chce</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"20px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"300px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"/> <path d=\"M12 11h4\"/> <path d=\"M12 16h4\"/> <path d=\"M8 11h.01\"/> <path d=\"M8 16h.01\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nowy klient podaje formę opodatkowania i liczbę dokumentów, zanim porozmawiacie</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Formularz zapytania z gotowymi przedziałami.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"/> <path d=\"M16 2v3\"/> <rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M3 9h18\"/> <path d=\"m9 15 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rozmowa o współpracy w kalendarzu, poza sezonem i w sezonie</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ty ustawiasz godziny, a klient wybiera wolny termin.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719\"/> <path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"/> <path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Odpowiedzi na pytania o KSeF, dokumenty i zmianę biura</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Napisane z Twojej ankiety, Twoimi słowami.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 17V7\"/> <path d=\"M16 8h-6a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h4a2 2 0 0 1 0 4H8\"/> <path d=\"M4 3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1 1.3 1.3 0 0 1 .7.2l.933.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 0 1.4 0l.934-.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 1 1.4 0l.933.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 0 1.4 0l.933-.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 1 1.4 0l.934.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 0 1.4 0l.933-.6A1.3 1.3 0 0 1 19 2a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v18a1 1 0 0 1-1 1 1.3 1.3 0 0 1-.7-.2l-.933-.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 0-1.4 0l-.934.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 1-1.4 0l-.933-.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 0-1.4 0l-.933.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 1-1.4 0l-.934-.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 0-1.4 0l-.933.6a1.3 1.3 0 0 1-.7.2 1 1 0 0 1-1-1z\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ceny „od”, które odsiewają pytania o „najtaniej”</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dokładną kwotę podajesz po rozmowie.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"jak-wyglada\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"jak-wyglada\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-naglowek-sekcji mp-srodek\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-naglowek-sekcji mp-srodek\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Jak to wygląda</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Zapytanie, które <em>nie</em> zajmuje linii</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-ekrany\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"32px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-ekrany\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":18,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://mateuszprzetocki.pl/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/biura-formularz.webp\" alt=\"Formularz zapytania o współpracę z przedziałami\" class=\"wp-image-18\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mp-opis\"} -->\n<p class=\"mp-opis\">Klient zaznacza przedziały, bez dokumentów</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":19,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://mateuszprzetocki.pl/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/biura-pytania-termin.webp\" alt=\"Najczęstsze pytania i wybór terminu rozmowy\" class=\"wp-image-19\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mp-opis\"} -->\n<p class=\"mp-opis\">Czyta odpowiedzi i wybiera termin rozmowy</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":20,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://mateuszprzetocki.pl/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/biura-potwierdzenie.webp\" alt=\"Potwierdzenie rozmowy o współpracy\" class=\"wp-image-20\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mp-opis\"} -->\n<p class=\"mp-opis\">Ty wiesz, z jaką firmą rozmawiasz</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline ze-strzalka\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline ze-strzalka\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/realizacje/#kalendarz\">Zobacz film z kalendarza</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"backgroundColor\":\"piasek\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"przepisy\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-piasek-background-color has-background\" id=\"przepisy\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"40%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Zasady</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">O co dbam na stronie <em>biura</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"grafit\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-grafit-color has-text-color\">Zaufanie budują konkrety, nie obietnice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"60%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-lista-tarcza\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-lista-tarcza\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Formularz zapytania z przedziałami: forma opodatkowania, dokumenty miesięcznie, pracownicy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ubezpieczenie OC biura i doświadczenie jako dowody zaufania.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bez obietnic w stylu „oszczędzisz na podatkach”.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"pakiet\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"pakiet\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"55%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Polecany pakiet</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dla biura: wizytówka, która <em>umawia</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Formularz zapytania i kalendarz rozmów są w nim od razu, a odpowiedzi na stałe pytania odciążają telefon w sezonie.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-strzalka\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-strzalka\"><a href=\"/oferta/\">Zobacz wszystkie pakiety</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"45%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:45%\"><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"article\",\"className\":\"is-style-pakiet-polecany\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-group is-style-pakiet-polecany\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-etykieta-czarna\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-etykieta-czarna\">Polecam</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wizytówka, która umawia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-cena\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-cena\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1 800</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>zł</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mp-dla\"} -->\n<p class=\"mp-dla\">Gdy chcesz mniej telefonów i krótsze pierwsze rozmowy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-lista-pakiet\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-lista-pakiet\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Jedna strona, 6 sekcji, wersja na telefon</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Formularz zapytania i kalendarz rozmów</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Odpowiedzi na najczęstsze pytania i miejsce na opinie</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Profil Firmy w Google, gdy firma spełnia wytyczne</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"ze-strzalka\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button ze-strzalka\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#ankieta\">Wyceń stronę w 5 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></article>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"pytania\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"pytania\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"40%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Pytania biur</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Zanim <em>zapytasz</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-strzalka\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-strzalka\"><a href=\"/pytania/\">Wszystkie pytania</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"60%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-pytania\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-pytania\"><!-- wp:details {\"showContent\":true,\"className\":\"is-style-pytanie\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-style-pytanie\" open><summary>Czy mogę podać na stronie ceny?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tak, jako ceny „od”. Odsiewają pytania o „najtaniej”, a dokładną kwotę podajesz po rozmowie.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"className\":\"is-style-pytanie\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-style-pytanie\"><summary>Czy klient wyśle przez formularz dokumenty firmy?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nie. Formularz pyta tylko o przedziały: formę opodatkowania, liczbę dokumentów i pracowników. Dokumenty klient przekazuje już w ramach współpracy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"className\":\"is-style-pytanie\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-style-pytanie\"><summary>Co z sezonem PIT?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kalendarz pokazuje tylko godziny, które ustawisz. W sezonie zostawiasz mniej terminów na rozmowy, a strona dalej odpowiada na stałe pytania.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"className\":\"is-style-pytanie\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-style-pytanie\"><summary>Czy napiszesz teksty o KSeF?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Napiszę je z Twojej ankiety, Twoimi słowami. Merytorykę sprawdzasz Ty, bo to Twoja specjalizacja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"nastepny-krok\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"nastepny-krok\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Następny krok</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"czern\",\"textColor\":\"krem\",\"className\":\"is-style-cta is-style-ciemna\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"20px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-cta is-style-ciemna has-krem-color has-czern-background-color has-text-color has-background\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sprawdź, ile kosztowałaby <em>Twoja</em> strona</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5 minut pytań, jednostronicowa propozycja w 48 godzin. Wypełnienie do niczego nie zobowiązuje.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"ze-strzalka\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button ze-strzalka\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#ankieta\">Wyceń stronę w 5 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/rozmowa/\">Wolisz porozmawiać? Umów 30 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-zobacz-tez\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-zobacz-tez\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zobacz też:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-strzalka\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-strzalka\"><a href=\"/dla-kogo/doradcy-kredytowi/\">Doradcy kredytowi</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-strzalka\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-strzalka\"><a href=\"/dla-kogo/psycholodzy-i-terapeuci/\">Psycholodzy i terapeuci</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
